# Agentic Version Control
# .avc/ holds the local database and object store — never commit it
.avc/
# .avcignore is intentionally committable so contributors share the same AVC ignore rules
# .claude/ is intentionally committed — Claude Code skills live there

# GoReleaser — temp file generated by before hook from CHANGELOG.md; not a source file
.goreleaser-release-notes.md
